se randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nThe night is deep, and everyone in the community immerses in sweet dreams. Suddenly, Xiao Chen turns the stereo to the highest level, playing songs loudly. Xiao Guang and Xiao Li wake up because of the noise. They step onto the balcony and see Xiao Chen on the balcony of the opposite building, laughing at them with schadenfreude. Xiao Li frowns, prepares to confront Xiao Chen, and picks up a baseball bat. At this moment, Xiao Guang stops Xiao Li, waves at Xiao Li, and then walks downstairs. Xiao Chen sees Xiao Guang coming from the corridor.\n\n[Question]\nXiao Chen sees Xiao Guang coming over, how does he feel?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Xiao Chen feels excited, thinking he can continue to prank.\nB. Xiao Chen feels nervous and surprised, he does not expect Xiao Guang to come directly to him to solve the problem.\nC. Xiao Chen feels depressed, because Xiao Li does not come with Xiao Guang.\nD. Xiao Chen does not care, he thinks Xiao Guang just comes to play with him.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.002182639376211902,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af3e24bd6006945d28020c5","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794368075373,"createTime":"2026-11-11 11:34:35","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"fd4dedc1eca84c059879dcb6537ea3bc"}